      },
      "note": [
        "Pursuant to Chapter 7, Section 21 of the Environmental Code, an area that is, or is likely to be, used as a water catchment may be designated a water protection area by a county administrative board or municipality.",
        "The County Administrative Boards are responsible for the decisions and registration of water protection areas. More information about the type of protection can be found at the Swedish Agency for Marine and Water Management.",
        "The number per county does not sum up to the total number for the country due to some objects being located on both sides of the county border."
